# AI session artifacts (local audit, screenshots, build dumps — not committed)
# .agents/findings, .agents/plans, .agents/audit ARE tracked (98 files) — keep them commitable
# aaaduit: track ONLY the phase reports (*.md, ~120 KB total); ignore ALL
# heavy local evidence (~13 MB: server logs, PNG screenshots, txt/json dumps
# under evidence/).
# NOTE: contents-glob form is required — git cannot re-include inside an
# excluded directory, so we must not exclude `aaaduit/` itself.
.agents/aaaduit/*
!.agents/aaaduit/*.md
.agents/skills/
.agents/cache/
.agents/scratch/
.agents/sessions/
.agents/tmp/
.agents/telemetry/
.agents/transcripts/
.agents/logs/
.agents/notes/
.cursorindexing/
.gemini-shell/
.brain/
.agent/
